{title: Niño lindo}
{artist: Schola Cantorum de Venezuela}
{year: 1930}
{key: Em}
{time: 6/8}

{define: D base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 0}
{define: G base-fret 1 frets 0 2 3 2}
{define: B7 base-fret 1 frets 4 3 2 0}
{define: C base-fret 1 frets 0 0 0 3}
{define: A7 base-fret 1 frets 0 1 0 0}
{define: Em base-fret 1 frets 0 4 0 2}
{define: D7 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 3}
{define: Am base-fret 1 frets 2 0 0 0}

{start_of_verse: (Opcional)Intro}
[D]Niño [G]lindo, [D] ante ti me [G]rindo
[B7]Niño [C]lindo, [A7] eres [B7]tú mi [Em]Dios
[D]Niño [G]lindo, [D] ante ti me [G]rindo
[B7]Niño [C]lindo, [A7] eres [B7]tú mi [Em]Dios
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
[Em]Niño ·lindo, [B7] ante ti me [Em]rindo
[Em]Niño ·lindo, [B7] eres tú mi [Em]Dios
[D]Niño [G]lindo, [D] ante ti me [G]rindo
[B7]Niño [C]lindo, [A7] eres [B7]tú mi [Em]Dios
[D]Niño [G]lindo, [D] ante ti me [G]rindo
[B7]Niño [C]lindo, [A7] eres [B7]tú mi [Em]Dios

[Em]Esa tu hermo[D]sura, [D7]ese tu can[G]dor
[Em]El alma me [Am]roba, [B7]el alma me [C]roba
[A7]Me ro[B7]ba el a[Em]mor

[Em]Esa tu hermo[D]sura, [D7]ese tu can[G]dor
[Em]El alma me [Am]roba, [B7]el alma me [C]roba
[A7]Me ro[B7]ba el a[Em]mor
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_chorus: Coro}
